{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A once lifeless planet that has seen much in its time is now torn again by a war of influence between three factions of a once-unified synthetic life form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a hardcore 2D sandbox MMO, offering complete freedom and danger. Become anyone - but be ready for anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/extras/71d7da079b2543eafdc6f54d7640c0de.avif?t=1772472195\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Even when you play alone, the world of Veliri remains alive:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade NPCs sustain the economy, even when few players are online.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/extras/744645feae8fe16734a8ae1d983c93cb.avif?t=1772472195\" width=1560 height=1010 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bots mine resources, transport cargo, trade, and even communicate with each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/extras/31887b05201ca59662a153445e35d956.poster.avif?t=1772472195\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/extras/31887b05201ca59662a153445e35d956.webm?t=1772472195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/extras/31887b05201ca59662a153445e35d956.mp4?t=1772472195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constant battles for territories and just for fun are happening in the game world :)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/extras/395e6218d0f22ec1be1e2d1662ce83ed.poster.avif?t=1772472195\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/extras/395e6218d0f22ec1be1e2d1662ce83ed.webm?t=1772472195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/extras/395e6218d0f22ec1be1e2d1662ce83ed.mp4?t=1772472195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real-time combat with a non-target system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Firepower and Tactics:</strong> A vast arsenal from machine guns to missiles, mines, and head-on collisions. Choose weapons that fit your style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/extras/bb6a8556478f2f945eed27afb2b7c8e1.avif?t=1772472195\" width=1485 height=262 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beware of friendly fire!</strong> Projectiles don't distinguish between friend and foe. In group combat, tactics and coordination are more important than numbers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/extras/5783dd5dc63f0d13d17a38db864d9d71.poster.avif?t=1772472195\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/extras/5783dd5dc63f0d13d17a38db864d9d71.webm?t=1772472195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/extras/5783dd5dc63f0d13d17a38db864d9d71.mp4?t=1772472195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full-loot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death will take your cargo and may claim several items, but your primary equipment won't vanish into thin air. It will sustain damage and require repair.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cargo and part of your gear - your contribution to the world's cycle of items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hull - remains with you, but wears out with each death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills, bank account, and assets in bases - always with you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/extras/bcefc4e4546db14a437dfa946531463a.avif?t=1772472195\" width=946 height=650 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free Trade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any item that can be placed in a &quot;cargo&quot; hold can be sold on the market. Any item can be dropped on the ground or placed in a container, including game currency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even convert your credits into cash for particularly delicate deals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/extras/79fc6e02d175ea86236bc9f4744ab63d.avif?t=1772472195\" width=1256 height=462 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Freedom of Choice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you get tired of war, you can engage in trade, manufacturing, resource gathering, or become an archaeologist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the planet's secrets:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore anomalies and find logs of perished crews.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect fragments of the past to understand the present of Veliri.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/extras/40c7e5b719043c107dd2cbaa7d6442b6.avif?t=1772472195\" width=1560 height=560 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2828170?t=1772472195","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2828170?t=1772472195","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772472195","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772472195","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3100340,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A once lifeless planet that has seen much in its time is now torn again by a war of influence between three factions of a once-unified synthetic life form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a hardcore 2D sandbox MMO, offering complete freedom and danger. Become anyone - but be ready for anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/extras/71d7da079b2543eafdc6f54d7640c0de.avif?t=1772472195\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Even when you play alone, the world of Veliri remains alive:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade NPCs sustain the economy, even when few players are online.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/extras/744645feae8fe16734a8ae1d983c93cb.avif?t=1772472195\" width=1560 height=1010 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bots mine resources, transport cargo, trade, and even communicate with each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/extras/31887b05201ca59662a153445e35d956.poster.avif?t=1772472195\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/extras/31887b05201ca59662a153445e35d956.webm?t=1772472195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/extras/31887b05201ca59662a153445e35d956.mp4?t=1772472195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constant battles for territories and just for fun are happening in the game world :)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/extras/395e6218d0f22ec1be1e2d1662ce83ed.poster.avif?t=1772472195\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/extras/395e6218d0f22ec1be1e2d1662ce83ed.webm?t=1772472195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\