's cycle of items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hull - remains with you, but wears out with each death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills, bank account, and assets in bases - always with you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/extras/bcefc4e4546db14a437dfa946531463a.avif?t=1772472195\" width=946 height=650 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free Trade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any item that can be placed in a &quot;cargo&quot; hold can be sold on the market. Any item can be dropped on the ground or placed in a container, including game currency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even convert your credits into cash for particularly delicate deals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/extras/79fc6e02d175ea86236bc9f4744ab63d.avif?t=1772472195\" width=1256 height=462 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Freedom of Choice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you get tired of war, you can engage in trade, manufacturing, resource gathering, or become an archaeologist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the planet's secrets:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore anomalies and find logs of perished crews.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect fragments of the past to understand the present of Veliri.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/extras/40c7e5b719043c107dd2cbaa7d6442b6.avif?t=1772472195\" width=1560 height=560 /></span></p>","developers":["Otocolobus studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer